  "description": "PostgreSQL-specific testing utilities for EasyReasy.Database. Provisions per-checkout test databases with ownership markers, serialises cluster-wide bootstrap work with advisory locks, and creates shared cluster roles idempotently, so test suites in concurrent git worktrees can run against one PostgreSQL cluster without coordination. Also observes one backend waiting on another, so a concurrency test can prove it reached the interleaving it asserts about.",
